{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38695","headline":"塞上 · 戴司颜","name":"塞上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"空蹟昼苍茫，沙腥古战场。\n逢春多霰雪，生计在牛羊。\n冷角吹乡泪，乾榆落梦牀。\n从来山水客，谁谓到渔阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴司颜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}